{"segs": ["PA_mil_3.5.6:1.1"], "en": "The King said:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_mil_3.5.6:1.2"], "en": "\"Venerable Nāgasena, is an omniscient one (vedagu) found?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_mil_3.5.6:1.3"], "en": "The Elder replied:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_mil_3.5.6:1.4"], "en": "“In the ultimate sense, Great King, a ‘possessor of knowledge’ (vedagū) is not to be found.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_mil_3.5.6:2.1"], "en": "“Excellent, venerable Nāgasena!", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:59:40Z"},
